        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-799 (ensure controlled execution — Collections, Recourse Management, Reconciliation &amp; Portfolio Analytics (PA-189.3).) | - operational: assignment accuracy; CTL-27 (customer data); CTL-41 (audit-trail completeness).
