      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly close; recourse/buyback activity (W5407); credit deterioration
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: 1 provision/month
Owner: Finance (Receivables Finance)
Participants: Credit Manager, Finance Controller, External Auditor, CFO
Source: workflow W5412 — Recourse Exposure, Bad-Debt Buyback Reserve &amp; ECL Provisioning (PFRS 9)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5412_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5412_Lane1" name="Finance">
