      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5412_Start5" name="Monthly close; recourse/buyback activity (W5407); credit deterioration">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5412_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5412_Task6" name="Compute recourse exposure and expected credit loss (ECL) on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compute recourse exposure and expected credit loss (ECL) on recourse/bought-back receivables under PFRS 9.
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5412_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5412_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5412_Task7" name="Size the bad-debt/buyback reserve from recourse history and portfolio risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Size the bad-debt/buyback reserve from recourse history and portfolio risk (W5399).
Responsible (R): Credit Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5412_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5412_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5412_Task8" name="Post the ECL provision and reserve to GL (VS-17); document methodology.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Post the ECL provision and reserve to GL (VS-17); document methodology.
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5412_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5412_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5412_Task9" name="Reconcile provisions to credit-risk and recourse activity (W5407).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Reconcile provisions to credit-risk and recourse activity (W5407).
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5412_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5412_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5412_Task10" name="Confirm methodology with the external auditor annually (VS-21).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Confirm methodology with the external auditor annually (VS-21).
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5412_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5412_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
