      <bpmn:userTask id="W5413_Task5" name="Track factor performance: funding speed, dispute/rejection rate, fee accuracy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Track factor performance: funding speed, dispute/rejection rate, fee accuracy, and service responsiveness.
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5413_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5413_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5413_Task6" name="TPRM-monitor the factor/funder (financial standing, operational issues) —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TPRM-monitor the factor/funder (financial standing, operational issues) — VS-161.
Responsible (R): TPRM Analyst
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
