Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5413_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5413_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5413_Task9" name="Report factor performance to the treasury committee.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Report factor performance to the treasury committee.
